# Environment files
# Bare `.env` matters most: it holds real secrets and `COPY . .` would otherwise
# bake it into the builder layer. All config reaches the build via build args
# (see docker-compose.yml) and the runtime via the container environment.
.env
.env*.local
.env.development
.env.test
.env.production

